[LESSON]: Boolean fields modeled as presence/absence in sets or separate sigs (e.g., EmergencyPrivilege.activeAt).  
[EVENT]: Introduced abstract functions and predicates for clearance comparison and delegation expiration to address Alloy 6 limitations.  
[EVENT]: Mode variables and time modeled as var sigs and abstract currentTime for temporal state transitions.  
[EVENT]: Atomic simultaneous triggering modeled abstractly as predicate emergencyTrigger with constraints on exactly two administrators triggering at same time.  
[EVENT]: Mutual exclusivity constraints suspended during Emergency mode by conditional fact.  
[EVENT]: Emergency privileges and credential updates modeled as separate sigs with time sets/events to represent atomic state changes and events.  
[EVENT]: Delegation revocation modeled as set of revocation times, checked against current time.  
