- Modeled Time with integer mapping function `timeValue` to enable ordering and arithmetic.  
- Abstracted EmergencyTriggerEvent and ManualEarlyTerminationEvent as atomic events with cardinality constraints.  
- Explicitly parameterized Emergency mode duration as an integer constant.  
- Incorporated manual early termination by either administrator modifying modeEndTime.  
- Relaxed mutual exclusivity during Emergency mode by omitting constraints.  
- Modeled emergency privileges and credential updates as atomic state/event signatures with proper temporal activation.  
- Added comprehensive assertions to verify key requirements and constraints.  
- Provided incremental predicates for stepwise verification of requirements.  
- Ensured no duplicate enum literals to fix syntax error blocking verification.  
